      "sequence_position": 3,
      "problem": "Ffion has an authorized overdraft facility with her bank. Her bank balance on Monday was $-$43.74.$ To reduce her debt, Ffion decides to make a deposit of $$29.50$ into her bank account on the following Wednesday. What was Ffion's balance at the end of the day on Wednesday?",
      "worked_solution": "To determine the balance at the end of the day on Wedensday, we must add the amount of money Ffion deposited to the starting balance. This gives\n\n$$\n-$43.74+$29.50=-$14.24\n$$\n\nThus, Ffion's balance at the end of the day on Wednesday was $-$14.24.$",
